  id: wardrune
  displayName: Wardrune
  description: Unspent mana becomes a ward at the top of the wearer's own turn. Deliberately
    the WEAK affix of the old Runic family (see FightTuning.RunicWardConversionRate's
    own comment) -- a safety net for mana a caster was going to leave on the table
    anyway, not a build-around tank strategy. Runic's old bundle split four ways
    -- see Runic, Manaflow and Quickcast's own descriptions for the rest of the family.
